    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "66b1c59cef0f1d0db8be": "Now is the time when the year is new and the moon shines bright.$B$BIt is our time... when the ancients awake.",
        "a426b7587f4b14cbbbb4": "Winterhoof? I hear he's living it up in Booty Bay.",
        "df8cd496a62ca26bd336": "Elder Stormbrow is most likely at the village of Goldshire in Elwynn Forest.",
        "f91fc2c957a91cb625c6": "Elder Hammershout can be found within the walls of Stormwind.",
        "fbc7538b3bc091d64e58": "Elder Dawnstrider can be found at Flame Crest on the Burning Steppes."
      },
      "name": "Elder Rumblerock",
      "translationMetadata": {
